{# Replica Corpus Validation Template
   Validates a generated corpus.yaml against the CorpusConfig contract.
   This is the automated Check phase of the PDCA loop — it runs regardless
   of mode (agentic or curated) and catches template drift, missing required
   fields, and shape mismatches before the corpus reaches corpus_build_persona.

   The validation calls EmbedService::parse_config on the rendered YAML and
   reports parse success/failure plus field coverage. The convergence_metric
   is 0.0 (converged) if parse succeeds, 1.0 (not converged) if it fails.

   Variables:
     corpus_yaml: string — the rendered corpus.yaml content to validate
#}
